1
00:00:00,126 --> 00:00:01,856
It's okay, she's here!

2
00:00:01,861 --> 00:00:02,991
(Howard:)Ma's here.

3
00:00:02,995 --> 00:00:04,565
(Bernadette:)Okay, thank you so much.

4
00:00:04,563 --> 00:00:06,093
(Howard:)Ma?

5
00:00:06,098 --> 00:00:08,028
(Howard:)I'm sorry I didn't

6
00:00:08,034 --> 00:00:10,604
(Howard:)take you to the airport.
I just want you to know

7
00:00:10,603 --> 00:00:13,503
(Howard:)that I'll never forgive myself
for being so selfish.

8
00:00:13,506 --> 00:00:15,006
(Howard:)And I promise

9
00:00:15,007 --> 00:00:16,807
(Howard:)to keep you close

10
00:00:16,809 --> 00:00:19,949
(Howard:)for the rest of my life.

11
00:00:19,946 --> 00:00:23,576
(Bernadette:)Oh, no. That thing's gonna
end up in my bedroom.

12
00:00:26,552 --> 00:00:28,352
That's it! We're done
with the questions.

13
00:00:28,354 --> 00:00:29,984
(Penny:)All that's left to do is

14
00:00:29,989 --> 00:00:31,019
(Penny:)stare into each other's eyes

15
00:00:31,023 --> 00:00:32,453
(Amy:)for four minutes
without talking.

16
00:00:32,458 --> 00:00:34,328
Okay. Wait, hang on!

17
00:00:34,327 --> 00:00:36,857
(Sheldon:)Bladder check.

18
00:00:36,862 --> 00:00:39,862
(Sheldon:)We're good to go.

19
00:00:39,865 --> 00:00:42,135
(Penny:)You ready?

20
00:00:42,134 --> 00:00:43,164
(Amy:)Yes.

21
00:00:43,169 --> 00:01:00,019
(Penny:)And begin.

